== Variations ==
=== Gusher ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Gusher
 | variant     = 0
 | image name  = * {{dlc|nr|Rebirth}}
 | base hp     = 10
 | environment = {{floor|Basement}}{{floor|Cellar}}{{floor|Burning Basement}}<br>{{floor|Downpour}}{{floor|Dross}}
 | behavior    = Walks aimlessly around the room, occasionally firing a short-ranged blood shot.
}}

'''Gushers''' wander around a room aimlessly, similar to Pacers, but will occasionally shoot a short ranged slow-moving, blood shot in whichever direction they happen to be moving in. They can be spawned from all the same sources as the Pacer with the addition of {{e|Leper}}s which will always spawn a grey-colored Gusher upon death.

==== Notes ====
* [[Champion|Pure Magenta Champion]] Gushers will spit two blood shots at different intervals.
{{clear}}

